I appreciate the clear communication, modern facilities, personalize as needed.\n\nIt’s comforting to know I have a doctor who genuinely cares about my well being. I highly recommend Dr. Daneshrad to anyone looking for a reliable and compassionate healthcare","languageCode":"en"},"rating":5,"publishTime":"2024-12-13T16:41:36.294990Z","originalText":{"text":"I’ve been a patient of Dr. Daneshrad for a years, and I couldn’t be more pleased with the level of care I’ve received. He consistently demonstrates professionalism, empathy, and attentiveness. Whether it’s a routine check-up or addressing a specific concern, Dr. Daneshrad takes the time to listen and provide thorough explanations.\n\nThe office staff is friendly and efficient, and appointments are always well-organized. I appreciate the clear communication, modern facilities, personalize as needed.\n\nIt’s comforting to know I have a doctor who genuinely cares about my well being. I highly recommend Dr. Daneshrad to anyone looking for a reliable and compassionate healthcare","languageCode":"en"},"googleMapsUri":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2cmR2LVhBEAE!2m1!1s0x80c2b94d5ebb08a3:0x6b7ea33edaae4d71","flagContentUri":"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2cmR2LVhBEAE&d=17924085&t=1","authorAttribution":{"uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118156819239997662897/reviews","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKSOOEY1ek9rbq1Z8pcngZHxiJ0zCrsrTArC0-J-1WGJ846BQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","displayName":"Casey Amini"},"relativePublishTimeDescription":"a year ago"},{"name":"places/ChIJowi7Xk25woARcU2u2j6jfms/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyemV2UmlRRRAB","text":{"text":"I have been a patient of Dr. Shaun Daneshrad for the past 10 years, and I cannot speak highly enough about the exceptional care I have received. From my very first visit, Dr. Daneshrad has consistently demonstrated professionalism, kindness, and an unwavering dedication to my health and well-being.\n\nDespite living in Orange County, I gladly make the drive to Beverly Hills just to see Dr. Daneshrad because their level of care and expertise is truly unmatched. The trust I have in Dr. Daneshrad is worth every mile traveled.\n\nDr. Daneshrad takes the time to listen carefully to my concerns, always ensuring I feel heard and understood. Their ability to explain complex medical information in a clear and reassuring way has helped me feel confident in the decisions we’ve made regarding my care. Whether for routine visits, preventive care, or addressing specific health issues, Dr. Daneshrad has always been thorough, patient, and compassionate.\n\nIn addition to Dr. Daneshrad , I have to commend the amazing staff members who work alongside them. Every member of the team is welcoming, professional, and efficient, creating a warm and seamless experience from the moment I walk in. It’s clear that they care deeply about each patient, and their kindness and attention to detail make every visit pleasant and stress-free.\n\nWhat truly sets Dr. Daneshrad apart is their genuine care for their patients. They go above and beyond to ensure I receive the best possible treatment, and they approach every interaction with kindness and respect. It’s rare to find a doctor who combines this level of expertise with such a warm and personal approach.\n\nI feel incredibly fortunate to have Dr. Daneshrad as my physician for the last decade. I wholeheartedly recommend them to anyone seeking a knowledgeable, compassionate, and dedicated doctor who truly cares about their patients’ well-being.\n\nThank you, Dr. Daneshrad, and your wonderful staff for being such a positive and trusted presence in my life for so many years. I’ll continue making the drive from Orange County because the care I receive from you is simply irreplaceable.","languageCode":"en"},"rating":5,"publishTime":"2024-12-16T00:11:53.573140Z","originalText":{"text":"I have been a patient of Dr. Shaun Daneshrad for the past 10 years, and I cannot speak highly enough about the exceptional care I have received. From my very first visit, Dr. Daneshrad has consistently demonstrated professionalism, kindness, and an unwavering dedication to my health and well-being.\n\nDespite living in Orange County, I gladly make the drive to Beverly Hills just to see Dr. Daneshrad because their level of care and expertise is truly unmatched. The trust I have in Dr. Daneshrad is worth every mile traveled.\n\nDr. Daneshrad takes the time to listen carefully to my concerns, always ensuring I feel heard and understood. Their ability to explain complex medical information in a clear and reassuring way has helped me feel confident in the decisions we’ve made regarding my care. Whether for routine visits, preventive care, or addressing specific health issues, Dr. Daneshrad has always been thorough, patient, and compassionate.\n\nIn addition to Dr. Daneshrad , I have to commend the amazing staff members who work alongside them. Every member of the team is welcoming, professional, and efficient, creating a warm and seamless experience from the moment I walk in. It’s clear that they care deeply about each patient, and their kindness and attention to detail make every visit pleasant and stress-free.\n\nWhat truly sets Dr. Daneshrad apart is their genuine care for their patients. They go above and beyond to ensure I receive the best possible treatment, and they approach every interaction with kindness and respect. It’s rare to find a doctor who combines this level of expertise with such a warm and personal approach.\n\nI feel incredibly fortunate to have Dr. Daneshrad as my physician for the last decade. I wholeheartedly recommend them to anyone seeking a knowledgeable, compassionate, and dedicated doctor who truly cares about their patients’ well-being.\n\nThank you, Dr. Daneshrad, and your wonderful staff for being such a positive and trusted presence in my life for so many years. I’ll continue making the drive from Orange County because the care I receive from you is simply irreplaceable.","languageCode":"en"},"googleMapsUri":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyemV2UmlRRRAB!2m1!1s0x80c2b94d5ebb08a3:0x6b7ea33edaae4d71","flagContentUri":"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyemV2UmlRRRAB&d=17924085&t=1","authorAttribution":{"uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114170597859077876467/reviews","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU25hBvTB5L0DztlDzeBLRbI_92jJDSc53iUg_ZUrv-3teY8s3zLA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","displayName":"Lili K"},"relativePublishTimeDescription":"a year ago"},{"name":"places/ChIJowi7Xk25woARcU2u2j6jfms/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvNGJHektREAE","text":{"text":"I became a patient of Dr. Daneshrad in 2022 after relocating to LA from NYC. I require regular monitoring for an aortic aneurysm. That year, he ordered a CT scan with contrast for pre-op clearance. I was never contacted about the results, so I assumed there were no issues and proceeded with surgery.\n\nIn 2024, during a follow-up for another pre-op clearance, he appeared alarmed when reviewing my chart. He asked if I had ever undergone a CT scan with him, then located the 2022 results — which he seemed to be seeing for the first time, two years later.\n\nUpon reviewing it, he panicked, ordered an urgent CT scan, and mentioned the possible need for thoracic surgery. The original 2022 scan had shown significant aortic dilation — information that had never been communicated to me. The new scan showed less dramatic changes, but he questioned its accuracy and promised to follow up with the technician. He never did. I never heard from Dr. Daneshrad again.\n\nI have since moved my care to USC Cardiology, where I have received thorough, attentive treatment. Their surgeon reviewed the 2022 scan and described it as one of the worst-quality scans he had ever seen.\n\nWhile Dr. Daneshrad may have helped many others, my experience was marked by neglect, poor communication, and a clear lack of follow-through. Every visit felt rushed and chaotic, and my trust in his care was ultimately broken.","languageCode":"en"},"rating":1,"publishTime":"2025-04-25T19:57:52.074647Z","originalText":{"text":"I became a patient of Dr. Daneshrad in 2022 after relocating to LA from NYC. I require regular monitoring for an aortic aneurysm. That year, he ordered a CT scan with contrast for pre-op clearance. I was never contacted about the results, so I assumed there were no issues and proceeded with surgery.\n\nIn 2024, during a follow-up for another pre-op clearance, he appeared alarmed when reviewing my chart. He asked if I had ever undergone a CT scan with him, then located the 2022 results — which he seemed to be seeing for the first time, two years later.\n\nUpon reviewing it, he panicked, ordered an urgent CT scan, and mentioned the possible need for thoracic surgery. The original 2022 scan had shown significant aortic dilation — information that had never been communicated to me. The new scan showed less dramatic changes, but he questioned its accuracy and promised to follow up with the technician. He never did. I never heard from Dr. Daneshrad again.\n\nI have since moved my care to USC Cardiology, where I have received thorough, attentive treatment. Their surgeon reviewed the 2022 scan and described it as one of the worst-quality scans he had ever seen.\n\nWhile Dr. Daneshrad may have helped many others, my experience was marked by neglect, poor communication, and a clear lack of follow-through. Every visit felt rushed and chaotic, and my trust in his care was ultimately broken.","languageCode":"en"},"googleMapsUri":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvNGJHektREAE!2m1!1s0x80c2b94d5ebb08a3:0x6b7ea33edaae4d71","flagContentUri":"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvNGJHektREAE&d=17924085&t=1","authorAttribution":{"uri":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108225512279732919525/reviews","photoUri":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXW0re7NnhxCN050PurUIoYmcMaJc2gENzOM8qbT7hWqs9DD8o8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3","displayName":"Jason Burke"},"relativePublishTimeDescription":"a year ago"}],"displayName":{"text":"Shaun Daneshrad, MD, FACC","languageCode":"en"},"userRatingCount":29,"formattedAddress":"8920 Wilshire Blvd Suite 420, Beverly Hills, CA 90211, USA"},"expires_at":"2026-08-11T02:37:55.224-07:00","fetched_at":"2026-07-12T02:37:55.224-07:00","location_id":9062,"display_name":"Shaun Daneshrad, MD, FACC","match_status":"details_verified","provider_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJowi7Xk25woARcU2u2j6jfms","review_count":29,"match_confidence":1,"provider_place_id":"ChIJowi7Xk25woARcU2u2j6jfms"},{"rating":4.9,"provider":"google_places","raw_json":{"id":"ChIJ38F-KEa32YgRmb-mvvQUbFI","rating":4.9,"reviews":[{"name":"places/ChIJ38F-KEa32YgRmb-mvvQUbFI/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRVZsQmZWV1IwT1ZaRmNsTjJTRlJvVkROUlNXYxAB","text":{"text":"Love the center and it's professional team. Charles walked me through the details of a full scan, options and preventive measures. Definitely, no pressure to purchase any products.  He was professional and explained thoroughly.","languageCode":"en"},"rating":5,"publishTime":"2026-05-23T21:29:07.642540203Z","originalText":{"text":"Love the center and it's professional team. Charles walked me through the details of a full scan, options and preventive measures. Definitely, no pressure to purchase any products.  He was professional and explained thoroughly.","languageCode":"en"},"googleMapsUri":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRVZsQmZWV1IwT1ZaRmNsTjJTRlJvVkROUlNXYxAB!2m1!1s0x88d9b746287ec1df:0x526c14f4bea6bf99","flagContentUri":"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?pos